  "post_content": "<p>(19 fotos) C&agrave;rrecs electes de formacions municipals afins a PODEM i simpatitzants han copat la sala d&#39;actes de la Casa de la Cultura d&#39;Onda durant la celebraci&oacute; del III F&oacute;rum Municipalista de la formaci&oacute; morada. &quot;Agra&iuml;m especialment l&#39;assist&egrave;ncia dels companys i companyes de les comarques m&eacute;s allunyades malgrat el mal temps&quot;, assenyalava el&nbsp; secretari general de Podem Onda Manu Escrig Azor durant la presentaci&oacute;, en la qual han participat Claudia Varella i Marif&eacute; Blanes, tamb&eacute; organitzadores.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foremmunicipalistapodemaonda/img_4296.jpg\" alt=\"img_4296\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foremmunicipalistapodemaonda/img_4297.jpg\" alt=\"img_4297\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foremmunicipalistapodemaonda/img_4298.jpg\" alt=\"img_4298\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foremmunicipalistapodemaonda/img_4299.jpg\" alt=\"img_4299\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foremmunicipalistapodemaonda/img_4300.jpg\" alt=\"img_4300\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foremmunicipalistapodemaonda/img_4303.jpg\" alt=\"img_4303\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foremmunicipalistapodemaonda/img_4304.jpg\" alt=\"img_4304\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/foremmunicipalistapodemaonda/img_4305.jpg\" alt=\"img_4305\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\"